# Search ignore rules (ripgrep and other tools that read .ignore; git does not).
# The atlas map pages list every file path in the repo, so any repo-wide search for a path matched them and
# flooded the result (IW-14 in copilot/knowledge/ai-agents/instruction-wording-findings.md). They are generated by
# `node copilot/atlas/tools/atlas.mjs --write`; to search them anyway: rg --no-ignore-dot <pattern> copilot/atlas/map
copilot/atlas/map/
